<jmeterTestPlan version="1.2" properties="5.0" jmeter="5.6.3">
  <hashTree>
    <TestPlan guiclass="TestPlanGui" testclass="TestPlan" testname="EShop STRESS - 23127362 - 2026-08-15" enabled="true">
      <stringProp name="TestPlan.comments">Kich ban STRESS. Tang tai theo bac de tim diem gay.
Bac 25 -&gt; 50 -&gt; 100 -&gt; 200 -&gt; 300 thread, moi bac 300s (30s ramp + 270s hold).
Ba Ultimate Thread Group (plugin jpgc-casutg 3.1.1), moi dong ket thuc tai t = 1500s.
Cong don: TG-1 = 210, TG-2 = 75, TG-3 = 15.

k = 0.25 -&gt; chu ky TG-1 = 5s, TG-2 = 0.5s, TG-3 = 3s.
Ti le login KHONG DOI khi nhan chung mot he so k vao moi think time:
rate_g = n_g*s_g/(k*c_g) nen k triet tieu o ca tu va mau.
Throughput ly thuyet theo bac: 39.2 / 79.0 / 158.0 / 316.0 / 474.0 req/s
Ghi vao SQLite theo bac:      20.5 / 42.0 /  84.7 / 169.3 / 254.0 lan/s
Login share theo bac:         40.65 / 40.51 / 41.56 / 41.56 / 41.56 %

TIEU CHI DIEM GAY -- TU THAM CHIEU, khong so voi baseline cua Load
(ho so tai da khac nen p95 cua Load KHONG con la moc hop le):
  TC-1 hieu suat throughput  E_i = X_i(dat)/X_i(ly thuyet) &lt; 0.90
  TC-2 loi ich bien          m_i &lt; 0.5 * m_2   (m_2 = bac 25-&gt;50 lam moc noi tai)
  TC-3 do tre tu tham chieu  p95_i &gt; 3 * p95 cua BAC 1 trong chinh run nay
  TC-4 loi                   error rate &gt; 0, hoac bat ky loi ket noi/timeout nao
Diem gay = bac thap nhat vi pham bat ky tieu chi nao.
HIEU LUC: chi hop le neu CPU tien trinh JMeter &lt; 50% tong CPU tai bac do;
neu khong, do la tran CONG CU chu khong phai tran SUT -- phai ghi ro nhu vay.

Cua so phan tich: 60s cuoi moi bac.
LUU Y: TG-3 o bac 1-2 chi co ~90 va ~180 mau DELETE -- chi bao cao count va
median cho cac nhan cua TG-3 o hai bac do, KHONG bao cao p95.

CHAY NGAY SAU KHI: restart server -&gt; provision-accounts.js -&gt; warm-up.
Du lieu do lay tu file -l, KHONG lay tu listener.
Aggregate Report co chu y de DISABLED khi chay: no phai giu toan bo ~306.000
gia tri elapsed de tinh percentile, khong duoc an heap cua tien trinh tao tai.
Bat no lai trong mot phien GUI rieng voi -Xmx2g de nap .jtl va chup man hinh.</stringProp>
